      "id": 226548,
      "name": "PlatinumWarlock",
      "username": "PlatinumWarlock",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
      "created_at": "2019-04-20T06:16:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Fave team so far has been:</p>\n<p>Legacy (base)</p>\n<p>Tachyon (super scientific variant)</p>\n<p>Tempest (base)</p>\n<p>Mr. Fixer (base)</p>\n<p>Harpy (Dark Watch variant)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Legacy brings the tanking and damage buffs, Tachyon brings plays and card draw.&nbsp; Tempest and Fixer are the AoE powerhouses, with a few side benefits (healing, Grease Gun), while Harpy brings the single target damage.&nbsp; Admittedly she's in the 'flex' position: I also like Scholar, Chrono Ranger, or Lifeline in that spot as well.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:00:31.065Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
